{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國超人氣女團IVE的靈魂人物張員瑛（Jang Won-young），早在13歲參加選秀生存戰《PRODUCE 48》便以第一名「C位」之姿橫空出世。憑藉9頭身的逆天身材比例與宛如精緻洋娃娃的絕美五官，她長年被外界盛讚為「人間芭比」，成為大批國際奢侈品牌寵兒。張員瑛將於今晚（16日）現身香港迪士尼出席聖誕亮燈揭幕活動，今早已有大量人群入園區霸位，為求目睹員瑛的風采，場面非常墟冚！</p><figure><img alt=\"韓國超人氣女團IVE的靈魂人物張員瑛。（IG/@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198981426847158272423681.jpeg/C4D9-9DyiA4ErnR9M4bcRExA_nlrMvFBbULLjW1Cy40\"/><figcaption>韓國超人氣女團IVE的靈魂人物張員瑛。（IG/@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張員瑛憑藉9頭身的逆天身材比例與宛如精緻洋娃娃的絕美五官，她長年被外界盛讚為「人間芭比」。（IG/@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198981423911014400107684.jpeg/nkNUnqNWb6POrULd1-rC3GstCgkCqr40hLShdoS0oXY\"/><figcaption>張員瑛憑藉9頭身的逆天身材比例與宛如精緻洋娃娃的絕美五官，她長年被外界盛讚為「人間芭比」。（IG/@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張員瑛將於今晚（16日）現身香港迪士尼出席聖誕亮燈揭幕活動。（IG/@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198981420882595840598743.jpeg/lrOAzTwUVp8Wcm7fgzYoNl3h9bdjLHZ7tNP5TrTT-U4\"/><figcaption>張員瑛將於今晚（16日）現身香港迪士尼出席聖誕亮燈揭幕活動。（IG/@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><p>樂園上午人群湧現提前霸位極墟冚</p><p>大批粉絲上午早早入園區霸位，中午起已聚集大量人群，目測已經有數百人在排隊，等候張員瑛現身。有網民在Threads分享迪士尼樂園的實時片段，可見大批粉絲排隊提前霸位，更有原本想入樂園玩的網民被嚇窒：「條隊長到不得了」、「今日星期一都咁多人 唔洗返學咩」、「平日都排到好似今年一月頭跨年+週年記諗咁 有啲誇張」、「員瑛嘅威力！」。</p><figure><img alt=\"大批粉絲上午早早入園區霸位。（threads/@lovecathcath）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198983712235065344629813.png/OjXjJ6_eTdfAVWlgqZ-3j0UCvFDme8OGXCsrPlwrKz4\"/><figcaption>大批粉絲上午早早入園區霸位。（threads/@lovecathcath）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中午起已聚集大量人群。（threads/@lovecathcath）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198983750307287040943820.png/c2Qjrl360d1s6RQiaFAT3jjE5RJXpi2mILHggSCx4IE\"/><figcaption>中午起已聚集大量人群。（threads/@lovecathcath）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"目測已經有數百人在排隊，等候張員瑛現身。（threads/@lovecathcath）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198983747887042560458063.png/nEiwuvOGBLC7oK1cjfqOjTcr6HOphRftH4lSax-JUms\"/><figcaption>目測已經有數百人在排隊，等候張員瑛現身。（threads/@lovecathcath）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批粉絲提前霸位。（threads/@lovecathcath）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198983745391300608756428.png/dPmJeIeK-6IW4RMg9qFmPRdskZj7hJS9Eq_y0BKv8tA\"/><figcaption>大批粉絲提前霸位。（threads/@lovecathcath）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好墟冚！（threads/@lovecathcath）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198983742895558656653710.png/JBqZuQ0aTl1Fq0afszBq9HSs-rdT9YJOAKQdpwCkHac\"/><figcaption>好墟冚！（threads/@lovecathcath）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中午12點已經有好多人入樂園等候偶像。（threads/@lovecathcath）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198983740198490112703246.png/_Xb4e_1IowcrTbjc7l9xfsWCZPFXqUOncmSDuXJkg7k\"/><figcaption>中午12點已經有好多人入樂園等候偶像。（threads/@lovecathcath）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:12:41.271558+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":752,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T05:00:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T05:06:16.154531+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T05:06:16.154531+00:00","content_hash":"5c5b7d3f68f60ca405595022cb516ff0d4625afd743e9e8df2917adeefe5e274","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}